# BIOSPHERE-AI — BIOSPHERE herbal cosmetics manufacturer (Guangzhou, China)

> Cosmetics OEM / ODM / OBM contract manufacturer based in Guangzhou, China,
> with a second plant in Indonesia. Herbal-biotech focus: Eastern herbs and
> Amazonian botanicals, AI-assisted formulation, in-house GMP production.

